; Pins `:version "1.0.0"` against a manifest that also declares
; `:version "1.0.0"`. The filesystem resolver compares the strings
; byte-for-byte and resolves cleanly. Proves the happy path of the
; (use-plugin … :version …) enforcement added in D3.
(use-plugin "shapes" :version "1.0.0")

(circle :r 4)
